{"ID":"20250915194759-rthbpbk","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250915194759-rthbpbk","title":"UPL4-4——垂直同步带来的等待问题","type":"doc","updated":"20250915202626"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915202427-e84p1ur","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250915202427-e84p1ur","updated":"20250915202614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20250915202431-dz5spw8","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250915202431-dz5spw8","updated":"20250915202614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"Application.targetFrameRate \t// 帧率限制\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250915194759-6aatzia","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250915194759-6aatzia","updated":"20250915202156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"垂直同步的作用"}]},{"ID":"20250915194829-9fma11m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194829-9fma11m","updated":"20250915194847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在未开启垂直同步的情况下，游戏可能在显示器未完成当前帧的刷新时，就输出下一帧图像，\n导致屏幕的 上下部分显示的是不同的画面内容，这就是“画面撕裂”。\n垂直同步会强制显卡等待显示器刷新完成后再提交下一帧图像，从而避免撕裂。"}]},{"ID":"20250915194829-gkj8o5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194829-gkj8o5z","updated":"20250915194836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是它可能带来一些副作用"}]},{"ID":"20250915194836-j9rfn9j","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194836-j9rfn9j","updated":"20250915194836"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194836-9fs694u","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194836-9fs694u","updated":"20250915194836"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194836-hikfgt0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194836-hikfgt0","updated":"20250915194836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入延迟增加"}]},{"ID":"20250915194837-g9to5ok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194837-g9to5ok","updated":"20250915194837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏被迫等待显示器信号，延迟图像输出，会让操作感觉迟钝"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915194836-y9ymjoa","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194836-y9ymjoa","updated":"20250915194836"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194836-2bpicve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194836-2bpicve","updated":"20250915194836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帧率下降"}]},{"ID":"20250915194838-zjburk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194838-zjburk1","updated":"20250915194838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果帧率无法维持在刷新率水平，垂直同步会强行降档到下一个可整除值（如从 60 → 30FPS），造成明显卡顿"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250915194829-8s06uie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194829-8s06uie","updated":"20250915202156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此在使用垂直同步时应根据实际情况而定："}]},{"ID":"20250915194833-uuun8gj","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194833-uuun8gj","updated":"20250915194903"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194833-ra8hs73","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194833-ra8hs73","updated":"20250915194833"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194833-flb1kcd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194833-flb1kcd","updated":"20250915194833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对图像撕裂特别敏感的游戏（如第三人称 3D、赛车等）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915194833-7z45bay","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194833-7z45bay","updated":"20250915194903"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194833-bjxws2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194833-bjxws2y","updated":"20250915194903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏帧率远高于显示器刷新率，容易画面撕裂"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915194833-ihv9h4e","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194833-ihv9h4e","updated":"20250915194833"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194833-6wm1nh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194833-6wm1nh6","updated":"20250915194833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对输入延迟不特别敏感的项目"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250915194854-c7txxd7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250915194854-c7txxd7","updated":"20250915195156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"垂直同步影响帧率具体分析"}]},{"ID":"20250915194909-rc11cm6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194909-rc11cm6","updated":"20250915194909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显示器通常以固定的频率刷新画面（如 60Hz 表示每秒刷新 60 次，每帧 16.67ms）\n而游戏中渲染图像的速度通常不固定，有时快于显示器刷新，有时慢于\n垂直同步（VSync）会强制游戏等显示器准备好再提交新帧，避免屏幕撕裂"}]},{"ID":"20250915194909-ep6kjy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194909-ep6kjy8","updated":"20250915195156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样可能造成两个问题"}]},{"ID":"20250915195156-0m1aiz5","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195156-0m1aiz5","updated":"20250915195156"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195156-xt822g7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195156-xt822g7","updated":"20250915195156"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195156-fhsmnh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195156-fhsmnh9","updated":"20250915195156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果游戏渲染太快，它要等一等（游戏帧率会降低）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195156-x6sfihy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195156-x6sfihy","updated":"20250915195156"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195156-ekkcw3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195156-ekkcw3b","updated":"20250915195156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果游戏渲染太慢，它只能跳过一帧，延后一轮提交（游戏帧率会降低）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250915194909-3qnjpo8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194909-3qnjpo8","updated":"20250915194922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"影响帧率主要有两种情况："}]},{"ID":"20250915194920-d9b6e2m","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194920-d9b6e2m","updated":"20250915195015"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194920-96yyc64","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194920-96yyc64","updated":"20250915194920"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194920-8sa3t9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194920-8sa3t9j","updated":"20250915194920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏帧率略高于刷新率，会强制等待"}]},{"ID":"20250915194926-lezr3kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194926-lezr3kj","updated":"20250915194929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如游戏渲染能力是 90FPS，而显示器是 60Hz，垂直同步开启后，项目 只能 每 16.67ms 渲一帧，即游戏被“卡”在 60FPS"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915194920-rqyc7ye","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194920-rqyc7ye","updated":"20250915195015"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194920-0g61jid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194920-0g61jid","updated":"20250915194920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏帧率低于刷新率 ，会被“降档”处理"}]},{"ID":"20250915194936-7x2voxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194936-7x2voxx","updated":"20250915195015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如游戏当前只能 50FPS，而显示器是 60Hz，垂直同步要求必须整除刷新频率（开启垂直同步时，游戏的帧率必须与显示器刷新率成整数倍的关系）\n于是 游戏 被“降档”到 30FPS（60 ÷ 2），这会造成严重卡顿或掉帧感"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250915194909-uagd5ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194909-uagd5ez","updated":"20250915194912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也就是说，垂直同步的开启可能带来游戏帧率下降的问题\n如果游戏帧率的下降给玩家带来了不好的体验，建议谨慎使用垂直同步\n特别是游戏帧率低于显示器刷新率的时候，可以不用开启垂直同步"}]},{"ID":"20250915195023-vx5q2af","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250915195023-vx5q2af","updated":"20250915195204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 中如何设置垂直同步开关"}]},{"ID":"20250915195152-a34nzo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-a34nzo7","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 的垂直同步如何设置"}]},{"ID":"20250915195152-iccjtd8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-iccjtd8","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195152-jwqpesi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-jwqpesi","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195152-gjccyrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-gjccyrf","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 的垂直同步设置 API 为： "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"QualitySettings.vSyncCount"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，其中，设置不同值代表："}]},{"ID":"20250915195152-nx6mmbc","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-nx6mmbc","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"QualitySettings.vSyncCount = 0;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250915195152-oyvjptv","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-oyvjptv","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195152-s5rqiy1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-s5rqiy1","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195152-sw1168e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-sw1168e","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ : 关闭垂直同步"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195152-gxwn0hn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-gxwn0hn","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195152-abwi68e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-abwi68e","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ : 每帧同步"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195152-svix6s3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-svix6s3","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195152-5gs8hjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-5gs8hjy","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ : 隔一帧同步"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195152-wxr7fou","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-wxr7fou","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195152-ztln525","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-ztln525","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"编辑器中设置"}]},{"ID":"20250915195152-xsoc0er","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-xsoc0er","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Edit \u003e Project Settings \u003e Quality"}]},{"ID":"20250915195152-qr2jv4x","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-qr2jv4x","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20250915195152-65fc5lj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195152-65fc5lj","updated":"20250915195152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLink